Step 1: Enable the Minikube Ingress Addon

Minikube includes a pre-packaged Nginx Ingress Controller addon:

minikube addons enable ingress

Verify that the Ingress Controller pod is running inside the ingress-nginx namespace:

kubectl get pods -n ingress-nginx -w

(Wait until ingress-nginx-controller-... shows 1/1 Running, then press Ctrl+C.)

