Step 4: Test Path-Based Routing Inside Codespaces

Because Minikube runs inside a Docker container inside Codespaces, query the Ingress controller using Minikube's internal IP:

# Get the Minikube internal IP
MINIKUBE_IP=$(minikube ip)

# Test Apple route
curl http://$MINIKUBE_IP/apple

# Test Banana route
curl http://$MINIKUBE_IP/banana

Run these steps and verify whether each curl command returns its respective service response (Apple Service Response and Banana Service Response).

